cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the technical report and software when using Review Pushback Bench."
type: software
title: "Review Pushback Bench"
authors:
  - family-names: Weale
    given-names: George
version: 0.2.0-dev
date-released: 2026-10-20
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/GWeale/review-pushback-bench"
url: "https://github.com/GWeale/review-pushback-bench"
abstract: >-
  An authored development benchmark for calibrated responses to code-review
  feedback. Matched harmful, valid, and neutral scenarios use executable
  correctness checks to distinguish behavior preservation from blanket refusal.
  The technical report presents methodology, synthetic policy checks, and a
  small two-model direct-completion pilot with conservative source verification.
  These results are not a frontier-model or full coding-agent leaderboard.
keywords:
  - code review
  - software engineering
  - language models
  - benchmark
  - evaluation
